  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 802.41 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 802.41 “Person” means “person” as defined by RSA 485-A:2, IX, namely “any municipality, governmental subdivision, public or private corporation, individual, partnership, or other entity.”\n\nSource. #10998, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14571, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36 (formerly Env-Wq 802.34)",
